## Examples (Ví dụ)

### Ví dụ: Complete Billing Flow

```typescript
async function upgradeSubscription(
  customerId: string,
  newPlanId: string
): Promise<void> {
  const customer = await getCustomer(customerId);
  const currentSubscription = customer.subscription;
  const newPlan = PLANS.find(p => p.id === newPlanId);
  
  // Calculate prorated amount
  const proration = calculateProration(
    currentSubscription.plan,
    newPlan,
    currentSubscription.currentPeriodEnd
  );
  
  // Update subscription
  await stripe.subscriptions.update(currentSubscription.stripeId, {
    items: [{ id: currentSubscription.stripeItemId, price: newPlan.stripePriceId }],
    proration_behavior: 'create_prorations'
  });
  
  // Charge difference
  if (proration.amount > 0) {
    await stripe.invoices.createInvoiceItem({
      customer: customer.stripeId,
      amount: Math.round(proration.amount * 100),
      currency: 'usd',
      description: `Proration for upgrade to ${newPlan.name}`
    });
  }
  
  // Update local record
  await subscriptionRepo.update(customerId, { planId: newPlanId });
}
```

## Anti Pattern

- [ ] **No Idempotency**: Duplicate charges
- [ ] **No Audit Trail**: Missing transaction history
- [ ] **Floating Point Math**: Inaccurate calculations
- [ ] **No Webhook Verification**: Security vulnerability

## Best Practice

- [ ] **Idempotency Keys**: Prevent duplicate charges
- [ ] **Decimal Math**: Use precise calculations
- [ ] **Audit Logging**: Track all transactions
- [ ] **Webhook Verification**: Validate signatures

